{{Term/Store|Shard of Naydra's Fang|Shards of Naydra's Fang|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Shard of Naydra's Fang}}<br/>This shard fell from the blue spirit Naydra's fang. It's much harder than any metal, so it's impossible to process. Yet rumors say it can be used as a material for something.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Shard of Naydra's Fang}}<br/>A piece that chipped off one of Naydra's  fangs. It's much harder than any metal. Attach it to a weapon to greatly increase its attack power, or cook it into a meal.|Inventory|TotK}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Shards of Naydra's Fang can be gathered by shooting the dragon [[Naydra]] in the lower mouth. The spot it was shot will glow, and the Shard will fall to the ground. [[Cooking]] with a Shard of Naydra's Fang will always result in [[Dubious Food]]. They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] as an ingredient to make Light Blue [[Dye]].

Shards of Naydra's Fang are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Shard of Naydra's Fang}}

